          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " lo captura a él. El peón que avanza a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " ataca a ese caballo, pero el caballo se retira y no recuperas nada: has dado un caballo por un peón."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For each candidate, ask what the rival’s best answer is, not the one you would like. And finish one branch before you start another, so you do not mix them up. Here the white knight takes the pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", but the black knight on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " takes it. The pawn that goes to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " attacks that knight, but the knight steps away and you win nothing back: you have given a knight for a pawn."
          }
        ]
      },
